From 7180000000000000000000000000000000000003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parcel Play OS <kernel@parcel.invalid>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 01:02:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] selftests: add Parcel FreeBSD translation smoke tests

Test sendfile data integrity and inventory the upstream mechanisms selected for
the FreeBSD comparison. Performance is not a pass/fail condition.

Signed-off-by: Parcel Play OS <kernel@parcel.invalid>
---
 tools/testing/selftests/Makefile | 1 +
 tools/testing/selftests/parcel_freebsd/Makefile | 7 +
 tools/testing/selftests/parcel_freebsd/parcel_features.sh | 61 +
 tools/testing/selftests/parcel_freebsd/parcel_sendfile.c | 78 +
 4 files changed, 147 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tools/testing/selftests/parcel_freebsd/Makefile
 create mode 100755 tools/testing/selftests/parcel_freebsd/parcel_features.sh
 create mode 100644 tools/testing/selftests/parcel_freebsd/parcel_sendfile.c

